#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (MessageToolTipEnabled), group (MessageListView)
#: core/settings.kcfg:11
msgid "Display tooltips for messages and group headers"
msgstr "Kortinformatschonen för Narichten un Koppel-Koppdaten wiesen"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (MessageToolTipEnabled), group (MessageListView)
#: core/settings.kcfg:12
msgid ""
"Enable this option to display tooltips when hovering over an item in the "
"message list."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du de Kortinformatschonen wiest kriegen wullt, bides Du op "
"en Indrag binnen de Narichtenlist wiest."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (AutoHideTabBarWithSingleTab), group (MessageListView)
#: core/settings.kcfg:16
msgid "Hide tab bar when only one tab is open"
msgstr "Paneelbalken versteken, wenn dat bloots een Paneel gifft"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (AutoHideTabBarWithSingleTab), group (MessageListView)
#: core/settings.kcfg:17
msgid ""
"With this option enabled the tab bar will be displayed only when there are "
"two or more tabs. With this option disabled the tab bar will be always "
"shown. When the tab bar is hidden you can always open a folder in a new tab "
"by middle-clicking it."
msgstr ""
"Maakst Du dit an, warrt de Paneelbalken bloots wiest, wenn dat twee oder "
"mehr Paneels gifft; anners warrt de Balken jümmers wiest. Is de Paneelbalken "
"versteken, kannst Du mit en Middelklick en Orner liekers binnen en nieg "
"Paneel opmaken."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (TabsHaveCloseButton), group (MessageListView)
#: core/settings.kcfg:21
msgid "Show close button on each tab"
msgstr "Tomaak-Knoop op elk Paneel wiesen"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (TabsHaveCloseButton), group (MessageListView)
#: core/settings.kcfg:22
msgid "Enable this option if you want to have a close button on each tab."
msgstr "Maak dit an, wenn Du op elk Paneel en Tomaakknoop hebben wullt."

